	(text "Link to the analog module: 24-pin 1.0 mm FFC (top and bottom contact).\n1-3 +5V_MOD (eFuse U59, ~1 A limit, on at power-up; PD10 low = off)\n4-6 GND, 7 DAC_SCLK, 8 DAC_DIN, 9 DAC_SYNC, 10 GND\n11 ADC_SCLK, 12 ADC_SDO, 13 ADC_SDI, 14 GND, 15 ADC_CNVST, 16 GND\n17 MOD_I2C_SDA (PF0), 18 MOD_I2C_SCL (PF1), own bus, 4.7k pull-ups, 19 GND, 20 MOD_RESET# (PD8), 21 MOD_PRESENT# (PD9, module ties to GND)\n22 GND, 23 MOD_SPARE (PD13), 24 GND. FLT# = PD11, PG = PD12.\nBridge power: USB2 (USB-A, back panel) = always-on 5 V for the Wi-Fi bridge through eFuse U60 (~1 A, on at power-up;\nPD14 low = off), FLT# = PD15, PG = PG2. D+/D- tied like USB1. USB1 stays target power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
